
============================================================================================
THREAD D: the relation-code LP HIERARCHY for measS7 (level-1 -> level-2)
============================================================================================
Per shape E we report:
  measS7 = actual P(M=emptyset)               (the truth)
  L1bnd  = level-1 LP optimum (singleton-marginal-only, joint-law LP)
  L2bnd  = level-2 LP optimum (singleton + PAIR marginals fixed)
A bound IMPROVES (collapses->improves) at level 2 iff L2bnd < L1bnd strictly.
The hierarchy PINS the shape iff L2bnd == measS7 (LP optimum equals truth).

